{"code": "ba45-25", "contradiction": 1, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "The Plump Heron slides through the dark past the Weeping Locks again... At six, grey light finds Tanner's Stair (Locks to Marrowmere is many hours, not one night's drift)", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "You can't help looking up at the great sluice-gates... you imagine the river pouring through them."}
